s://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159146421","name":"卡贝萨斯港","country":"NIC","lat":14.03334,"lon":-83.38337,"kind":"city","region":"NI-AN","rank":6,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159146425","name":"莱昂","country":"NIC","lat":12.43556,"lon":-86.87944,"kind":"city","region":"NI-LE","rank":6,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"莱昂 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"莱昂位于奇基托河畔，即在首都马那瓜以西北约50英里，太平洋海岸以北11英里。","culture":"建于1524年，1609年毁于地震，1610年城市迁至现址，1858年前曾为尼加拉瓜首都。","see":"2011年，市内的莱昂大教堂也被列为世界遗产，使得莱昂成为了有两座世界遗产的城市。","scope":"reference","qid":"Q208151","articleTitle":"莱昂 (尼加拉瓜)","sourceRevision":94719571,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 莱昂 (尼加拉瓜)","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8E%B1%E6%98%82%20%28%E5%B0%BC%E5%8A%A0%E6%8B%89%E7%93%9C%29"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94719571"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q208151"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159147941","name":"布盧菲爾茲","country":"NIC","lat":11.99998,"lon":-83.76495,"kind":"city","region":"NI-AS","rank":6,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"布盧菲爾茲 · 地点概要","geo":"当地的官方语言为西班牙语、英语和米斯基托语。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q885996","articleTitle":"布盧菲爾茲","sourceRevision":88123983,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 布卢菲尔兹","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B8%83%E7%9B%A7%E8%8F%B2%E7%88%BE%E8%8C%B2"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88123983"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q885996"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159135781","name":"里瓦斯","country":"NIC","lat":11.44037,"lon":-85.81999,"kind":"city","region":"NI-RI","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159135787","name":"聖胡安德尼加拉瓜","country":"NIC","lat":10.92041,"lon":-83.69999,"kind":"city","region":"NI-SJ","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159136105","name":"格拉纳达","country":"NIC","lat":11.93373,"lon":-85.94998,"kind":"city","region":"NI-GR","rank":7,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"格拉纳达 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"格拉纳达（西班牙语：）位于尼加拉瓜西南部尼加拉瓜湖畔，是尼加拉瓜第四大城市，也是格拉纳达省的首府，历史上一直是尼加拉瓜的经济、文化重镇。","culture":"格拉纳达是西班牙人在尼加拉瓜建立的第一座城市，最初在1524年，由弗朗西斯科·埃尔南德斯·德·科尔多瓦所建立，并以其家乡格拉纳达命名，格拉纳达是中美洲最古老的殖民地城市之一；与其他声称有相同区别的城市不同，格拉纳达不仅是征服的定居点，而且是亚拉冈王朝官方记录中登记的城市。\n这座城市自古以来就是尼加拉瓜的商业重镇，也是横跨太平洋和加勒比海的交通枢纽，但也因为这个原因，建城以来不断的受到各种武力的入侵。","see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q205648","articleTitle":"格拉纳达 (尼加拉瓜)","sourceRevision":94356674,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 格拉纳达 (尼加拉瓜)","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A0%BC%E6%8B%89%E7%BA%B3%E8%BE%BE%20%28%E5%B0%BC%E5%8A%A0%E6%8B%89%E7%93%9C%29"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94356674"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q205648"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159136111","name":"奇南德加","country":"NIC","lat":12.63038,"lon":-87.13004,"kind":"city","region":"NI-CI","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159136115","name":"馬塔加爾帕","country":"NIC","lat":12.91708,"lon":-85.91665,"kind":"city","region":"NI-MT","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159127765","name":"南聖胡安","country":"NIC","lat":11.25,"lon":-85.86004,"kind":"city","region":"NI-RI","rank":8,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"南聖胡安 · 地点概要","geo":"南圣胡安，是尼加拉瓜的一个城镇，位于该国西南部，由里瓦斯省负责管辖，始建于1851年，面积411平方公里，海拔高度92米。\n位于海湾北面，修建在海岸的最高点，亦是世界上最高的耶稣雕像之一。\n南圣胡安西临太平洋，因其位于尼加拉瓜湖和太平洋之间的里瓦斯地峡，因而成为修建尼加拉