,"country":"NIC","lat":11.846,"lon":-86.195,"kind":"city","region":"NI-CA","rank":9,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159122225","name":"希诺特加","country":"NIC","lat":13.091,"lon":-86.0,"kind":"city","region":"NI-JI","rank":9,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"希诺特加 · 地点概要","geo":"希诺特加是一个位在尼加拉瓜希诺特加省的城​​市，其地理位置位于一个长型山谷中，因被山脉所包围，故气候凉爽，并距离尼加拉瓜首都马拿瓜向北142公里处。\n山脉：钦博拉索山，，Cuspire，Kilambe（1750公尺），Zinica，Saslaya，Baba，Asan Rahra。\n高地山谷是亚热带和热带气候，夏季干燥，冬季降雨，山中凉爽。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q1026296","articleTitle":"希諾特加","sourceRevision":94265485,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 希诺特加","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B8%8C%E8%AB%BE%E7%89%B9%E5%8A%A0"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94265485"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1026296"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159122241","name":"马萨亚","country":"NIC","lat":11.969,"lon":-86.095,"kind":"city","region":"NI-MS","rank":9,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159115583","name":"索莫托","country":"NIC","lat":13.476,"lon":-86.583,"kind":"city","region":"NI-MD","rank":10,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159115603","name":"奥科塔尔","country":"NIC","lat":13.63,"lon":-86.473,"kind":"city","region":"NI-NS","rank":10,"capital":0}]}